---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact | Sideline Action — Sportfotograaf Antwerpen" description="Neem contact op met Sideline Action voor voetbalfotografie in Antwerpen en omgeving.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="label label--rule">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="page-head__title" data-reveal>Contact</h1>
        <p class="lead page-head__lead" data-reveal="fade">Een vraag over clubfotografie, een individuele spelersshoot, het aanbod of de afspraken? Stuur gerust een bericht.</p>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--top0">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="split split--top">
          <div>
            <ul class="contact-list" data-reveal="fade">
              <li><span class="row"><span class="k">Bedrijf</span><span class="v">Sideline Action</span><span></span></span></li>
              <li><span class="row"><span class="k">Fotograaf</span><span class="v">Harun Viteskic</span><span></span></span></li>
              <li><a href="mailto:harunviteskic50@gmail.com"><span class="k">E-mail</span><span class="v">harunviteskic50@gmail.com</span><svg class="btn-arrow" width="15" height="9" viewBox="0 0 15 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 1L14 4.5L10.5 8M14 4.5H0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a></li>
              <li><a href="https://instagram.com/sidelineaction" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="k">Instagram</span><span class="v">@sidelineaction</span><svg class="btn-arrow" width="15" height="9" viewBox="0 0 15 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 1L14 4.5L10.5 8M14 4.5H0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a></li>
              <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@sidelineaction" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="k">TikTok</span><span class="v">@sidelineaction</span><svg class="btn-arrow" width="15" height="9" viewBox="0 0 15 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 1L14 4.5L10.5 8M14 4.5H0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a></li>
              <li><span class="row"><span class="k">Regio</span><span class="v">Antwerpen en omgeving, België</span><span></span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="note mt-5" data-reveal="fade">
              <h2>Een wedstrijd of spelersshoot boeken?</h2>
              <p>Gebruik het boekingsformulier. Dan heb ik meteen de gegevens die ik nodig heb: soort opdracht, datum, uur en locatie.</p>
              <div class="btn-row mt-3"><a class="btn btn--solid" href="/boeken"><span>Boek een shoot</span><svg class="btn-arrow" width="15" height="9" viewBox="0 0 15 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 1L14 4.5L10.5 8M14 4.5H0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-reveal="mask">
            <div class="ratio ratio--45  ">

              <img src="/assets/img/site/contact.webp"
                   alt="Spelers in duel om de bal langs de zijlijn — Sideline Action, sportfotografie Antwerpen" width="900" height="1350"
                   loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
